 r←Test_TableEdit_010(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table
⍝ Make a table read-only
 r←T._Inactive
 :Return

 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 table←⍉⊃('Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan')('George' 'Bill' 'Ronald')(1986 1994 2002)
